WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.195
Your website changes all the time.

00:00:02.195 --> 00:00:03.938
Your SEO needs to keep up.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.529
Your team merges a homepage update.

00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:11.831
It looks good, but the main shopping button now leads to a missing page.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.974
Your Optimiser checks the changed page and follows its links.

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:20.556
It confirms the broken link and a missing page description.

00:00:22.067 --> 00:00:29.811
The agent reads the existing website, restores the working link, and writes a description using the page's own content.

00:00:29.811 --> 00:00:31.829
It tests the proposed changes.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:38.307
Your team reviews a focused fix, with a clear explanation of what changed and why.

00:00:38.307 --> 00:00:40.126
You choose when it goes live.

00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:45.064
After deployment, the agent checks the website again.

00:00:45.064 --> 00:00:48.949
The collection opens, and the page description is restored.

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:50.503
That closes this issue.

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:54.685
The next update only changes the spacing.

00:00:54.685 --> 00:00:57.660
Your Optimiser checks it and leaves it alone.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.601
No unnecessary fix or review.

00:01:01.133 --> 00:01:03.643
Checks continue between updates, too.

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:05.406
Your team keeps building.

00:01:05.406 --> 00:01:07.509
Your Optimiser keeps watching.

